{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rejecting the dogmatic vision of the machine and its endless production, you are cast down into darkness. But in the darkness, a bargain is struck with a foe of old. Ascend the machine citadel with eyes open, and bring a reckoning upon those who ruined the world before it was all iron, blood, and bones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741830/extras/ca334325afeecfae5f78a089d1b26554.avif?t=1767714868\" width=648 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the machine citadel, find secret paths to hidden chambers, and establish a foothold in the belly of the machine. Return to a Sanctuary with your plundered skulls to discover new and unusual items. Or instead, set your sights on conquest, assemble a clutch of potent items, and risk it all against the monstrous denizens that lurk in the dark corners of the citadel. But beware, your mayhem in defiance of the machine will not go unnoticed - enemies assembled to defeat you will grow in potency and number the longer you wreak havoc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741830/extras/9b6a3fd3f288802293f780045e165633.avif?t=1767714868\" width=648 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Machine mixes the wonder of classic metroidvania exploration, with exciting combat powered by a versatile roguelite item system. Each run, you can choose to focus on exploration - discovering new items and powers, hoarding skulls taken from your enemies, and making it back to take to a Sanctuary to cash in your loot with your patron. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741830/extras/939318921bacc180749d76f1a524035c.avif?t=1767714868\" width=648 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the spoils of your exploration to concoct mighty builds, letting you go toe to toe with the most dangerous residents of the citadel. Careful consideration when crafting your build will help you unlock certain pathways not accessible otherwise. Diverse builds will also let you wield potent hybrid items, bridging the mechanics of two elements together.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Goblins in your mines? It's more likely than you think!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2741830/159df408da0b2e7dd3015138c9af227adbbb51ea.jpg"},{"name":"Rest in Masterpieces","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2741830/66b4301c92905b9d1cd32a6f78fe6f39224a6332.jpg"},{"name":"Dewormed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2741830/ddb718e51422e8efbff9d8c04eb5e393222a683b.jpg"},{"name":"Let it Rip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2741830/6eef66d78a28c4c72d22cb22d6b6c39c1004627e.jpg"},{"name":"Long Live the Queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2741830/933ec60065610c1ff66c7b0f5fcf7986972bcd51.jpg"},{"name":"RIP 20ft Skeleton","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2741830/4f7ecea81fab6377b40573dfec3e97ba46115b08.jpg"},{"name":"He's not unemployed, he's a sculptor!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2741830/9f7ab8e111e6478a8fa2587edc754b68530b6a7a.jpg"},{"name":"When I die bury me in a tomb of gold so people will think I was cool","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2741830/9caae5bdadd279995d4b1911cddde785ece1b3b3.jpg"},{"name":"A king? I thought we were an autonomous collective.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2741830/c22805e98a0823905c8c405d22ec5191893f2bef.jpg"},{"name":"Broke the think tank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2741830/55e46cc795aa0d27b4f96a6c1f989d7125cd6bb9.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2741830?t=1767714868","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741830/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767714868","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741830/78bec9bbbb40d99105a808d262e4f83d970df877/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767714868","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741830/78bec9bbbb40d99105a808d262e4f83d970df877/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767714868","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains scenes of horror environments, creatures, blood, and violence."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rejecting the dogmatic vision of the machine and its endless production, you are cast down into darkness. But in the darkness, a bargain is struck with a foe of old. Ascend the machine citadel with eyes open, and bring a reckoning upon those who ruined the world before it was all iron, blood, and bones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741830/extras/ca334325afeecfae5f78a089d1b26554.avif?t=1767714868\" width=648 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the machine citadel, find secret paths to hidden chambers, and establish a foothold in the belly of the machine. Return to a Sanctuary with your plundered skulls to discover new and unusual items. Or instead, set your sights on conquest, assemble a clutch of potent items, and risk it all against the monstrous denizens that lurk in the dark corners of the citadel. But beware, your mayhem in defiance of the machine will not go unnoticed - enemies assembled to defeat you will grow in potency and number the longer you wreak havoc. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741830/extras/9b6a3fd3f288802293f780045e165633.avif?t=1767714868\" width=648 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Machine mixes the wonder of classic metroidvania exploration, with exciting combat powered by a versatile roguelite item system. Each run, you can choose to focus on exploration - discovering new items and powers, hoarding skulls taken from your enemies, and making it back to take to a Sanctuary to cash in your loot with your patron. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741830/extras/939318921bacc180749d76f1a524035c.avif?t=1767714868\" width=648 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the spoils of your exploration to concoct mighty builds, letting you go toe to toe with the most dangerous residents of the citadel. Careful consideration when crafting your build will help you unlock certain pathways not accessible otherwise. Diverse builds will also let you wield potent hybrid items, bridging the mechanics of two elements together.</p>","developers":["Philip Froelich"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2741830/85f2b2de38a7f385987552bf7d2d03d63e68576e/header.jpg?t=1767714868","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.a